      ],
      "id": "inherited_unit:010.table",
      "kind": "inherited_unit",
      "polarity": "SUPPORTED",
      "value": "| Format | Detect | Width / Height | Bit depth | Frame count |\n|--------|:------:|:---------------:|:---------:|:-----------:|\n| PNG    | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2705 |\n| JPEG   | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2014 |\n| GIF    | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2014 | \u2705 |\n| BMP    | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2014 |\n| WebP (lossy / lossless / extended) | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2014 | \u2014 |\n| ICO    | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2705 |\n| TIFF   | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2705 |\n| PSD    | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2014 |\n| EMF    | \u2705 | \u2705 (from bounds) | \u2014 | \u2014 |\n| WMF (placeable) | \u2705 | \u2705 (assumes 96 DPI) | \u2014 | \u2014 |\n| DICOM  | \u2705 | \u2705 (Rows/Columns) | \u2705 (BitsAllocated) | \u2014 |\n| DjVu (single-page DJVU / multi-page DJVM) | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2014 | \u2705 |\n| AVIF (still / animated) | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2014 | \u2014 |\n| HEIC / HEIF | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2014 | \u2014 |"
    },
    {
      "attributes": {
        "section": "Aspose.Imaging FOSS for .NET > Supported formats"
      },
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "evidence": [
        {
          "detail": "lines 46-49; paragraph; under Aspose.Imaging FOSS for .NET > Supported formats",
          "path": "README.md"
        }
      ],
      "id": "inherited_unit:011.paragraph",
      "kind": "inherited_unit",
      "polarity": "SUPPORTED",
      "value": "DICOM parsing covers Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little/Big Endian transfer\nsyntaxes (including the common compressed ones, whose non-pixel elements are Explicit VR\nLittle Endian); it stops rather than guesses if it hits a sequence or encapsulated pixel data\nwith an undefined length before finding Rows/Columns/BitsAllocated."
    },
    {
      "attributes": {
        "section": "Aspose.Imaging FOSS for .NET > Supported formats"
      },
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "evidence": [
        {
          "detail": "lines 51-52; paragraph; under Aspose.Imaging FOSS for .NET > Supported formats",
          "path": "README.md"
        }
      ],
      "id": "inherited_unit:012.paragraph",
      "kind": "inherited_unit",
      "polarity": "SUPPORTED",
      "value": "DjVu reads dimensions and frame count from the IFF chunk tree; multi-page files (DJVM) report\nthe page count from the DIRM directory chunk and dimensions from the first embedded DJVU page."
    },
    {
      "attributes": {
        "section": "Aspose.Imaging FOSS for .NET > Supported formats"
      },
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "evidence": [
        {
          "detail": "lines 54-56; paragraph; under Aspose.Imaging FOSS for .NET > Supported formats",
          "path": "README.md"
        }
      ],
      "id": "inherited_unit:013.paragraph",
      "kind": "inherited_unit",
      "polarity": "SUPPORTED",
      "value": "AVIF and HEIC/HEIF dimensions are read from the `ispe` (image spatial extent) property box\nvia the `meta \u2192 iprp \u2192 ipco \u2192 ispe` path. Brand detection covers `avif`/`avis` for AVIF and\n`heic`, `heix`, `hevc`, `hevx`, `mif1`/`mif2` for HEIC/HEIF."
    },
